Measure Start Up Time
    [Arguments]    ${gnb_id}=0   ${runs}=1    ${target}=0.99    ${time_target}=420    ${timeout}=600
    ...            ${du_id}=${0}  ${raise_exception}=${True}  ${reset_type}=bts_site_reset
    ...            ${radio_unit}=all_every_second_iteration    ${end_measure_time}=last_cell_up
    [Documentation]    Performs bts reset given amount of times, checks if site fully recovered and
    ...                measures start-up time, then checks if PASSED to RUNS ratio meets given target.
    ...    :param gnb_id:    GNB id - related to Test Line configuration.
    ...    :param du_id: DU id(Distributed Unit) - id related to Test Line configuration - gnb.dus[]
    ...    :param runs: Number of runs
    ...    :param target: Target PASSED to RUNS ratio
    ...    :param time_target: Target start-up time in seconds.
    ...    :param timeout: Wait for onAir after bts reset timeout in seconds.
    ...    :param raise_exception: raise exception when check failed - True/False
    ...    :param reset_type: Way of reset. Available: bts_site_reset, bts_power_reset, bbmod_reset, ru_reset.
    ...    :param radio_unit: ID of radio to reset or 'random' or 'all' or 'all_every_second_iteration'.
    ...                       Applicable only for ru_reset.
    ...    :param end_measure_time: last_cell_up or first_cell_up
    ...    :return: Dictionary containing: exceptions, avarage start-up time, passed ratio.
    ${results} =     gnbmeasurestartup.measure_start_up_time    bts_id=${gnb_id}  runs=${runs}  target=${target}  time_target=${time_target}
    ...    timeout=${timeout}    du_id=${du_id}    raise_exception=${raise_exception}    reset_type=${reset_type}
    ...    radio_unit=${radio_unit}    end_measure_time=${end_measure_time}
    [Return]    ${results}

